# Install hints for gar info on Synology (case-insensitive name match).
# Format: name|hint
git|DSM Package Center → Git Server, or: opkg install git
python3|opkg install python3
rsync|Usually preinstalled on DSM; otherwise: opkg install rsync
curl|Usually preinstalled on DSM; otherwise: opkg install curl
jq|opkg install jq
tar|Usually preinstalled on DSM
HandBrakeCLI|Not in Entware/opkg; run via Docker (Container Manager), e.g. image jlesage/handbrake, or install a static HandBrakeCLI build
user.name|git config --global user.name "Your Name"
user.email|git config --global user.email "you@example.com"
